<section class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
  <h2 class="font-mono text-lg mb-6 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2 text-white">Background</h2>

  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
    Eleven years at Google, most recently on the payments and monetization platform behind Google Play.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
    The work was rarely greenfield. Single-seller assumptions baked through a console that needed to support many sellers. A payments platform owned by another org that I could wrap but not change. A database migration that had to happen underneath live payment traffic, because there was no version of the plan where the money stopped moving. Most of what I did was change systems that were already load-bearing, already had users, and already had reasons for being the way they were.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
    That's the position an assessment starts from, and it's why I don't open one by telling you what to rewrite.
  </p>
